{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-nkj5-kbjb-cxpp-zav3","published":"2026-11-11T15:37:54Z","modified":"2026-11-24T13:00:14.558851946Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-11605"],"summary":"The issue is a resource exhaustion vulnerability associated with DNSSEC validation. BIND always validates all RRSIG…","details":"The issue is a resource exhaustion vulnerability associated with DNSSEC validation. BIND always validates all RRSIG records in an answer, even if they are not strictly needed. A query to an authoritative server/zone which returns many valid but superfluous RRSIG records causes the validator to waste disproportionate CPU time.\nThis issue affects BIND 9 versions 9.20.0 through 9.20.24, 9.21.0 through 9.21.23, and 9.20.9-S1 through 9.20.24-S1.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"bind","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.23","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/bind"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"9.18.13-r1"}]}],"versions":["9.18.13-r1","9.20.18-r0","9.20.19-r0","9.20.20-r0","9.20.21-r0","9.20.22-r0","9.20.23-r0","9.20.26-r0","9.20.29-r0","9.20.30-r0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-nkj5-kbjb-cxpp-zav3.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.24","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/bind"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"9.20.23-r0"}]}],"versions":["9.20.23-r0","9.20.24-r0","9.20.26-r0","9.20.27-r0","9.20.29-r0","9.20.30-r0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-nkj5-kbjb-cxpp-zav3.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://scout.docker.com/v/DHI-nkj5-kbjb-cxpp-zav3"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-11605"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://kb.isc.org/docs/cve-2026-11605"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://downloads.isc.org/isc/bind9/9.21.24"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://downlo